; ============================================================================
;  action.sqs  -  thin addAction dispatcher for the SHOWCASE menu.
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  addAction runs this FILE with _this = [target, caller, actionId] (same
;  contract as scripts/recruit_action.sqs). NO state mutation here: it only
;  enqueues, so run.sqs stays the single writer of every demo effect.
; ============================================================================

SC_REQ = _this select 2
SC_PENDING = true
exit
